  "goodToKnow": "Der Zwiespalt is an inner conflict or split between two opposing pulls: in einen Zwiespalt geraten, ein Zwiespalt der Gefühle. Zwie- is an old form of two, found also in Zwietracht (discord) and Zwielicht (twilight), while Spalt is a gap or crack. The adjective zwiespältig means ambivalent, as in ein zwiespältiger Eindruck. The noun is almost always singular."
